    "name": "Tiny Isle",
    "steam_appid": 3337180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>About Us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728Developer: <strong>Nature Rituals Studio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a team of four developers from diverse industries, developing games through remote work online. Despite having varying schedules, our collaboration has always proceeded smoothly, driven by our individual passion and shared sense of responsibility toward this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When conceptualizing the project, we deeply felt that in today\u2019s fast-paced lives, many people inevitably fall into prolonged periods of mental exhaustion. This is why we hope to create a healing simulation-building idle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will take on the role of manager of an island far from the hustle and bustle of the city. Here, you can grow crops, expand the island, and gradually explore the unique natural mysteries of this world. From time to time, fairy friends will visit and live on your island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If this game can bring you a moment of leisure and relaxation amidst a busy life, that will be our greatest achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Designer: Yiziao</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Technical Artist: Witness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Designer: Ahshee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text Content: Konoha</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728Publisher: <strong>Etherous Games Limited</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a team of 11 passionate developers who share a love for creating immersive gaming experiences. Our core team has over a decade of experience developing large-scale games, which has honed our expertise. Tired of the industrialized, commercial game world, we left our previous company to pursue our passion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Dungeon &amp; Delicious, we created Dragon Song Tavern: Cozy &amp; Adventurous\u2014a Steam-released adventure blending cozy relaxation, rich RPG storytelling, and light exploration thrills.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/4d23ad4b08d2ed43b86dc3e0ff290acb.avif?t=1753451209\" width=1360 height=398 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/5f97c8292c241daaaa17cfb5968a3db9.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tiny Isle, you'll discover a mysterious sprite civilization and help these creatures rebuild their homeland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this secluded island, you can cultivate magical plants to gather crystals, catch and collect fantastical fish, and attract adorable animal villagers to settle down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through your efforts, this forgotten isle will gradually come alive with vivid lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/8ae867a452fc3ad6e1b59f71940c7897.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Isle is a casual farming game where you can grow adorable crops and build your dream island! Cultivate a variety of cute plants and harvest energy-filled crystals. Use these crystals to expand your island's territory and unlock even more delightful crop varieties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely plant various magical mushrooms, succulents, and flowers to create your perfect island paradise with your unique aesthetic preference. Occasionally, new sprites and animal residents will visit the island. When you meet a companion you like, invite them to settle down in the island and make it their home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for a relaxing, stress-free farming game with delightful cute art, Tiny Isle might just be your perfect match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/b8b1e7a2f9d83e26ecfe5ea5bf66e719.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/2179becfd77202f3208b70c9d0dce3e4.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaeEasy-to-learn gameplay with no complex stats or overwhelming management systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0fFull terrain and decoration customization to create your unique island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/55920010db479bbdac7ba283627f594c.poster.avif?t=1753451209\" width=414 height=247 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/55920010db479bbdac7ba283627f594c.webm?t=1753451209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/0cd4373a57f0b0db1b7582c45a15a427.poster.avif?t=1753451209\" width=490 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/0cd4373a57f0b0db1b7582c45a15a427.webm?t=1753451209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/73813c6a033af77f2f112839625b748a.poster.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/73813c6a033af77f2f112839625b748a.webm?t=1753451209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8eCultivate crops across your island to harvest Crystals, then spend them to unlock new plant varieties and gradually expand your territory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31Every crop has its own superpower!  Some produce, some deliver, others boost your yields\u2014mix them right to skyrocket your Crystal output!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/239df92bace018b75fc595d3379f9001.avif?t=1753451209\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/e8de36d08416e46bc0e90edafb886b07.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33In addition to the island's indigenous inhabitants, new residents can also be recruited through tree hollows to temporarily settle on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddda\u200d\u2640\ufe0fEach resident possesses unique appearances and personalities, and they will assist with the island's production in their own distinctive ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0fBecome besties with the locals, and they\u2019ll put down permanent roots on your island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/d6b268d5aae7fb25b209762b4d592860.poster.avif?t=1753451209\" width=490 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/d6b268d5aae7fb25b209762b4d592860.webm?t=1753451209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/fcde12c8b8c58955b45797807127f5c4.poster.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/fcde12c8b8c58955b45797807127f5c4.webm?t=1753451209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/b14d544bdb2d25c39fd745f712e724ab.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3Cast your line around the island for a relaxing fishing trip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1fReel in all kinds of fish, then\u2014once you've honed your skills\u2014aim to break size records and even challenge legendary Fish Kings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/9afddf5ad9af3001d1e7080611a55c08.poster.avif?t=1753451209\" width=462 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/9afddf5ad9af3001d1e7080611a55c08.webm?t=1753451209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/d1efa4bd8612845ce40e62dadfe84c3d.avif?t=1753451209\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/ded3186c7d4386fda2b0c8200d2d4048.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0fYour island shifts moods with time and weather\u2014sunny vistas, stormy drama, even magical sky surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/a8aaa81edebf87be0b281593a888b72c.avif?t=1753451209\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/931aac560e10215e34da82e73881df7a.avif?t=1753451209\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/441b4950121ebda644271c1bff460527.poster.avif?t=1753451209\" width=435 height=259 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/441b4950121ebda644271c1bff460527.webm?t=1753451209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Thank you for your interest and support for <i>Tiny Isle</i>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run into any issues while playing\u2014or if you have fun ideas and creative thoughts to share\u2014you're warmly welcome to join our official <u><strong>Discord</strong></u>. Let\u2019s make this little island even more wonderful, together!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/4d23ad4b08d2ed43b86dc3e0ff290acb.avif?t=1753451209\" width=1360 height=398 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/5f97c8292c241daaaa17cfb5968a3db9.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tiny Isle, you'll discover a mysterious sprite civilization and help these creatures rebuild their homeland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this secluded island, you can cultivate magical plants to gather crystals, catch and collect fantastical fish, and attract adorable animal villagers to settle down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through your efforts, this forgotten isle will gradually come alive with vivid lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/8ae867a452fc3ad6e1b59f71940c7897.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Isle is a casual farming game where you can grow adorable crops and build your dream island! Cultivate a variety of cute plants and harvest energy-filled crystals. Use these crystals to expand your island's territory and unlock even more delightful crop varieties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely plant various magical mushrooms, succulents, and flowers to create your perfect island paradise with your unique aesthetic preference. Occasionally, new sprites and animal residents will visit the island. When you meet a companion you like, invite them to settle down in the island and make it their home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for a relaxing, stress-free farming game with delightful cute art, Tiny Isle might just be your perfect match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/b8b1e7a2f9d83e26ecfe5ea5bf66e719.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/2179becfd77202f3208b70c9d0dce3e4.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaeEasy-to-learn gameplay with no complex stats or overwhelming management systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0fFull terrain and decoration customization to create your unique island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/55920010db479bbdac7ba283627f594c.poster.avif?t=1753451209\" width=414 height=247 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/55920010db479bbdac7ba283627f594c.webm?t=1753451209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/0cd4373a57f0b0db1b7582c45a15a427.poster.avif?t=1753451209\" width=490 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/0cd4373a57f0b0db1b7582c45a15a427.webm?t=1753451209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/73813c6a033af77f2f112839625b748a.poster.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/73813c6a033af77f2f112839625b748a.webm?t=1753451209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8eCultivate crops across your island to harvest Crystals, then spend them to unlock new plant varieties and gradually expand your territory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31Every crop has its own superpower!  Some produce, some deliver, others boost your yields\u2014mix them right to skyrocket your Crystal output!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/239df92bace018b75fc595d3379f9001.avif?t=1753451209\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/e8de36d08416e46bc0e90edafb886b07.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33In addition to the island's indigenous inhabitants, new residents can also be recruited through tree hollows to temporarily settle on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddda\u200d\u2640\ufe0fEach resident possesses unique appearances and personalities, and they will assist with the island's production in their own distinctive ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0fBecome besties with the locals, and they\u2019ll put down permanent roots on your island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/d6b268d5aae7fb25b209762b4d592860.poster.avif?t=1753451209\" width=490 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/d6b268d5aae7fb25b209762b4d592860.webm?t=1753451209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/fcde12c8b8c58955b45797807127f5c4.poster.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/fcde12c8b8c58955b45797807127f5c4.webm?t=1753451209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/b14d544bdb2d25c39fd745f712e724ab.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3Cast your line around the island for a relaxing fishing trip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1fReel in all kinds of fish, then\u2014once you've honed your skills\u2014aim to break size records and even challenge legendary Fish Kings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/9afddf5ad9af3001d1e7080611a55c08.poster.avif?t=1753451209\" width=462 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/9afddf5ad9af3001d1e7080611a55c08.webm?t=1753451209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/d1efa4bd8612845ce40e62dadfe84c3d.avif?t=1753451209\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/ded3186c7d4386fda2b0c8200d2d4048.avif?t=1753451209\" width=680 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0fYour island shifts moods with time and weather\u2014sunny vistas, stormy drama, even magical sky surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/a8aaa81edebf87be0b281593a888b72c.avif?t=1753451209\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/931aac560e10215e34da82e73881df7a.avif?t=1753451209\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/441b4950121ebda644271c1bff460527.poster.avif?t=1753451209\" width=435 height=259 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/441b4950121ebda644271c1bff460527.webm?t=1753451209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Thank you for your interest and support for <i>Tiny Isle</i>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run into any issues while playing\u2014or if you have fun ideas and creative thoughts to share\u2014you're warmly welcome to join our official <u><strong>Discord</strong></u>. Let\u2019s make this little island even more wonderful, together!</p>",
    "short_description": "Tiny Isle is a cozy idle sim where you care for a magical island. Grow whimsical crops, collect sparkling crystals, and unlock fantastical new plants. Discover hidden secrets\u2014giant fish, strange weather, island expansion, and charming residents\u2014all at your own relaxing pace.",
